,"synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26209","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72025","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"22528","synopsis":"All the ships in the surrounding area around Lobnas II have to retreat because of an enemy sighting while Jinto is having problems reassuring Meideen and the rest of the evacuees that they will return in order to continue emigrating those with permission off the planet.\nWhile enjoying a sunset and thinking of Lafiel, Jinto receives a message that a rebellion has broken out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DC1Oc56sLDZ8B0TKnSWyGU3FB4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"All the ships in the surrounding area around Lobnas II have to retreat because of an enemy sighting while Jinto is having problems reassuring Meideen and the rest of the evacuees that they will return in order to continue emigrating those with permission off the planet.\nWhile enjoying a sunset and thinking of Lafiel, Jinto receives a message that a rebellion has broken out.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9DC1Oc56sLDZ8B0TKnSWyGU3FB4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26209","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72025","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"22530","synopsis":"As the rebellion continues, started by Angus and Dokufu, Dokufu's section is able to take control of the administration section. Meideen authorizes an immediate evacuation of the Western section (the women's section). Jinto decides to stay on the planet to ensure that all the Western section inhabitants are safely evacuated. While traveling to the Western section, Meideen and Jinto's vehicle is hi-jacked.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ucBExhaww2OmONddBNPE8u9tHrh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"As the rebellion continues, started by Angus and Dokufu, Dokufu's section is able to take control of the administration section. Meideen authorizes an immediate evacuation of the Western section (the women's section). Jinto decides to stay on the planet to ensure that all the Western section inhabitants are safely evacuated. While traveling to the Western section, Meideen and Jinto's vehicle is hi-jacked.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ucBExhaww2OmONddBNPE8u9tHrh.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26209","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72025","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"22522","synopsis":"Meideen is shot in the head and killed execution style because he refused to cancel the emigration order. Angus is threatened to be put in Abh Hell for his threatening a fellow Abh's life (Jinto). Against Lafiel's heart's wishes, being an Abriel, Lafiel is forced to abandon Jinto on Lobnas II for the time being.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/glfwYlcf4vWTyyiSt9B1ibPERWC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Meideen is shot in the head and killed execution style because he refused to cancel the emigration order. Angus is threatened to be put in Abh Hell for his threatening a fellow Abh's life (Jinto). Against Lafiel's heart's wishes, being an Abriel, Lafiel is forced to abandon Jinto on Lobnas II for the time being.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/glfwYlcf4vWTyyiSt9B1ibPERWC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26209","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72025","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"22529","synopsis":"Angus refuses to release Jinto because of his pride since he never backs down from a challenge. Dokufu is killed because he didn't want to suffer Abh Hell for Angus' stupidity. Lafiel requests help from Spoor in order to carry out the emigration plan. Spoor rejects the offer at first but then agrees. Lafiel heads down to Lobnas II to assist in emigration.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ycOWhEqC5ktd0CDiIE7duGyFD3o.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Angus refuses to release Jinto because of his pride since he never backs down from a challenge. Dokufu is killed because he didn't want to suffer Abh Hell for Angus' stupidity. Lafiel requests help from Spoor in order to carry out the emigration plan. Spoor rejects the offer at first but then agrees. Lafiel heads down to Lobnas II to assist in emigration.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ycOWhEqC5ktd0CDiIE7duGyFD3o.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumbe