 of Lobnas II was completed. Unfortunately, Spoor's fleet of thirty-three ships, twenty-six were destroyed.\nThe crew of the Basroil reminisce about experiences they shared with Jinto, assuming the worst about him. Fighting to stay in order to see Lafiel again, Jinto thinks back to all the adventures he had with Lafiel from the time when they first met to the theme park chase on Sufugnoff.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39ylfX2LeUl8Tkdud0y39beak0C.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Due to Spoor's assistance, the evacuation of Lobnas II was completed. Unfortunately, Spoor's fleet of thirty-three ships, twenty-six were destroyed.\nThe crew of the Basroil reminisce about experiences they shared with Jinto, assuming the worst about him. Fighting to stay in order to see Lafiel again, Jinto thinks back to all the adventures he had with Lafiel from the time when they first met to the theme park chase on Sufugnoff.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39ylfX2LeUl8Tkdud0y39beak0C.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"397","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"26209","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72025","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"22531","synopsis":"Lafiel is still searching for Jinto on Lobnas II. While she is patiently awaiting for Jinto to be found, Samson is preparing a meal for him. Jinto is found in a cave and Lafiel rushes to his side. She uses her endearing pet name for him, \"\"Fool\"\", and he calls her his \"\"Precious little Princess.\"\" Lafiel and Jinto are then shown on a hill by a tree presumably on Jinto's home planet, Martine.","thumbnail":"